data: {"id": "97134487c5284e89-thinking-parallel_evidence-973", "run_id": "97134487c5284e89", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我将基于已有的 Kubernetes 资源检查结果，进一步采集 Metrics、Logging、Tracing 和 Topology 数据来验证 NotReady 根因。\n\n**当前已知关键事实：**\n1. Pod 状态：Running，但 Ready=0/1（NotReady）\n2. 事件显示：Readiness probe 失败 - 初期 \"connection refused\"，后续 HTTP 503\n3. 日志显示：服务持续输出 HTTP 503 \"dependency unavailable\"\n\n**待验证假设：**\n- 根因1：服务启动慢，探针在应用就绪前探测\n- 根因2：应用依赖服务不可用，导致 503\n\n让我先获取日志和探针详情：\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788809938141, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

